Œ+ THE SERVANTS PATH +
In this stunning fully illustrated book are prayers that spiritually outline the true path you must take in order to bring yourself back to our Lord Jesus Christ, as a true servant of Him. "The Servants Path" starts you on your path towards Christ with the holy prayers used by the great Doctor of the Church Thomas A` Kempis, which are written in his book "The Imitation of Christ". His prayers give us a foundation, for truly understanding our relationship with Jesus Christ. "The Servants Path" then takes you on a journey into my soul, and shares with you all of my personal prayers, which I have used throughout my entire life. These prayers are for every life event, and I offer them whole-heartedly, for everyone seeking refuge in our Lord Jesus Christ. "The Servants Path" then guides us back home to all the essential prayers used throughout all of Catholicism.
"The Servants Path" is also complimented by my "Thoughts and Reflections" chapter, which opens up my mind and heart to all people, giving them a priceless key into my personal writings, just now being released for the first time. "The Servants Path" also includes all of my personal prayers of a selected group of Saints, who have walked with Jesus Christ throughout His life, and includes other Saints, who have fought the good fight throughout their entire lives. They truly deserve a place in our hearts and souls, as an example and a reminder, that anyone can be a Holy ambassador to our Jesus Christ here on earth.
"The Servants Path" reminds us that prayer is universally powerful, and we all need help now and again, to truly find our way back to, "The Servants Path".
