"To everyone who ever had their heart broken or restored, to everyone who ever lost hope, and to those that found it again - to everyone who has truly loved and to those who have lost, to everyone who sacrificed and to those who have been rewarded:
This book is dedicated to you. I share with you the trials and tribulations of my life, and the scriptures that only life experiences could bring which have been written upon my soul, that you too, may experience and learn the best and worst of what human nature has to offer and to see what my eyes have seen." Dominick Pepito
Dominick Pepito was born in Long Island in Babylon, New York. He started writing the"Soul Scriptures" when he was only 15 years old. His inspiration for writing the"Soul Scriptures"at such a young age was from the many religious experiences he had as a child.
Later, Dominick had an opportunity to do missionary work in Calabria, Italy. After doing some research, he discovered that his relatives were actually living in Bagnara, a province right in Calabria. With the finding of his family, this extraordinary event just fermented his belief in the Holy Spirit and the power and love of Jesus Christ.
Please feel free to send any questions or comments you may have to: Cath_Alliance_Holy_Trinity@Yahoo.com
Please visit our website: www.allianceoftheholytrinity.com"ã
àThe "Return to Christ" takes you on a beautifully illustrated journey through the actual life of Jesus Christ, the Holy prayers of the Saints, the writings of the Doctors of the Church and through the divine scriptures of the Holy Bible. Silently be present at the side of Jesus during the Nativity, walk with Jesus through His trials and tribulations, follow Him on His way to Calvary and the Holy Cross, and be a witness of His accent into heavenly glory.
The "Return to Christ" is for all those who are looking for a truly personal relationship with Jesus Christ, and brings your life to His heavenly salvation. The "Return to Christ" is designed through prayer and scripture, to help you find the spiritual essence of the teachings of Jesus Christ, and determine what lessons you choose to take with you and use throughout your entire life.
The prayers and scriptures of Jesus Christ found within this book are at the very heart and foundation, of what initially shaped and changed the entire world. The "Return to Christ" is dedicated to St. Dismas (The Good Thief), who was crucified on the cross next to Jesus. Let this Saint who cleansed his sins on the cross next to Christ, be an example and a hero of the faith to all people. He reminds us that even at the last breath of your life, by confessing your darkest sins and by declaring your faith and love for Jesus Christ, you can be saved through the love, grace, mercy, and power of our Lord Jesus Christ. The "Return to Christ" is to help guide all people on their own path to "Return to Christ".
For anyone who truly would like to experience the love and mercy of our Lord Jesus Christ, please give the priceless gift of salvation by introducing or reintroducing them to Jesus Christ.
