å+ THROUGH THE HEAVENLY GATES +
A BOOK OF SAINTS
"THE PATH OF SACRIFICE"
THE 1ST BOOK IN THE TRILOGY
*Virgins * Martyrs*
THIS EXCEPTIONAL ONE OF A KIND FULLY ILLUSTRATED BOOK, WILL TAKE YOU ON A JOURNEY THROUGH THE LIVES OF OVER 185 LIVES OF THE SAINTS. THIS BOOK IS THE THIRD IN THE SERIES WHICH CATALOGS OVER 550 LIVES OF THE SAINTS, WHO HAVE GIVEN UP EVERYTHING IN THIS WORLD, INCLUDING THEIR LIVES, FOR THE LOVE OF OUR LORD JESUS CHRIST.
WE SHOULD ALL FOLLOW IN THEIR FOOTSTEPS AND MIRROR OUR LIVES TO THEIR OWN, SO THAT WE MAY LEARN THROUGH THEIR HOLY EXAMPLES AND THEIR ULTIMATE SACRIFICES, HOW WE SHOULD COMPLETELY GIVE OURSELVES TO OUR LORD JESUS CHRIST EVERY DAY.
Just take a moment of your time... to think about the extraordinary sacrifices of all those that came before us, who paid the ultimate price for their faith and love of Our Lord Jesus Christ.
Words are absolutely fruitless when we try to describe the torture, pain, agony and the ultimate sacrifices, these men women and children endured for the love of our Lord Jesus Christ.
In writing the trilogy of "Through the Heavenly Gates", and researching about the lives of the Virgin and Martyred Saints, I was absolutely taken back and humbled by their strength, courage, humility, faith, passion and love for our Lord Jesus Christ. I found myself reexamining my own life and even asking myself, "Am I really doing enough?", "Is there any way I can give more of myself to Jesus Christ as these Saints have done?" The answer came to me in one simple word, "Yes".
Our Lord Jesus Christ died on the cross for us, so would it be so hard if we just stopped our day for Him, for just 5 minutes, to contemplate on the pain and the sacrifices that He endured throughout His life for all of us?
John 15:13
NEW AMERICAN BIBLE REVISED EDITION (NABRE)
13: No one has greater love than this, to lay down one's life for one's friends.
"Please ... come Walk with me, ... and let me share their lives with you, as I have been blessed to have them share their lives with me ..."- Dominick Pepito
